    "type": "game",
    "name": "Deep Pixel Melancholy",
    "steam_appid": 3694190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/828d064898dc5449069788a3dc68b242.poster.avif?t=1755442471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/828d064898dc5449069788a3dc68b242.webm?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/828d064898dc5449069788a3dc68b242.mp4?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A city is lost in a polar night. A snowstorm that never ends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the 2000s. In the far north. Egor works at a research institute, stuck pushing paper in the world\u2019s most soul-crushing job, but those utility bills won't pay themselves. He dreams of the sea, but let's face it \u2014 hell will freeze over before he can afford a vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His routine is shattered when he discovers he's stuck in a time loop. Trying to make sense of it, he\u2019s forced to face the real question: Why bother escaping at all? Tomorrow doesn't bode well, and maybe a single carefree day is all he needs to be happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/4678ae495fad9cbc0b41757213359061.avif?t=1755442471\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SILENCE OF STAIRWELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0<i>Deep Pixel Melancholy</i> is a visual novel about inner emptiness and the search for meaning. When one bad event follows another endlessly, what does it take to push through, and reignite a spark inside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Follow the story and experience each loop with Egor. Listen to his thoughts, interact with others, and choose a path that leads to one of several endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/d6a9960ca6a2918a975db1774a7e2a39.poster.avif?t=1755442471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/d6a9960ca6a2918a975db1774a7e2a39.webm?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/d6a9960ca6a2918a975db1774a7e2a39.mp4?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIFE LIKE A STUCK VHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Sink into the slow, heavy vibe of a wintry city, where the snow falls with quiet indifference and the polar night has no end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Pause for a moment, and take in the animated pixel art full of early-2000s nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Play through a variety of mini-games and interact with the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MYSTERIOUS PHENOMENA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I drop to the floor and bury my face in my hands. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Something\u2019s happening. Something I don\u2019t understand.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My thoughts buzz in my head like a huge traffic jam until the howling wind drowns them out. The storm carries me off somewhere far away.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Somewhere no one can reach me.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/863d168ade41c10b5fe2fdee6f554221.avif?t=1755442471\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/828d064898dc5449069788a3dc68b242.poster.avif?t=1755442471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/828d064898dc5449069788a3dc68b242.webm?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/828d064898dc5449069788a3dc68b242.mp4?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A city is lost in a polar night. A snowstorm that never ends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the 2000s. In the far north. Egor works at a research institute, stuck pushing paper in the world\u2019s most soul-crushing job, but those utility bills won't pay themselves. He dreams of the sea, but let's face it \u2014 hell will freeze over before he can afford a vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His routine is shattered when he discovers he's stuck in a time loop. Trying to make sense of it, he\u2019s forced to face the real question: Why bother escaping at all? Tomorrow doesn't bode well, and maybe a single carefree day is all he needs to be happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/4678ae495fad9cbc0b41757213359061.avif?t=1755442471\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SILENCE OF STAIRWELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0<i>Deep Pixel Melancholy</i> is a visual novel about inner emptiness and the search for meaning. When one bad event follows another endlessly, what does it take to push through, and reignite a spark inside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Follow the story and experience each loop with Egor. Listen to his thoughts, interact with others, and choose a path that leads to one of several endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/d6a9960ca6a2918a975db1774a7e2a39.poster.avif?t=1755442471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/d6a9960ca6a2918a975db1774a7e2a39.webm?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/d6a9960ca6a2918a975db1774a7e2a39.mp4?t=1755442471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIFE LIKE A STUCK VHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Sink into the slow, heavy vibe of a wintry city, where the snow falls with quiet indifference and the polar night has no end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Pause for a moment, and take in the animated pixel art full of early-2000s nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/995086ff042d6686c0a4ec659c4ac77e.webp?t=1755442471\" width=11 height=11 /></span>\u00a0Play through a variety of mini-games and interact with the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MYSTERIOUS PHENOMENA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I drop to the floor and bury my face in my hands. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Something\u2019s happening. Something I don\u2019t understand.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My thoughts buzz in my head like a huge traffic jam until the howling wind drowns them out. The storm carries me off somewhere far away.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Somewhere no one can reach me.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694190/extras/863d168ade41c10b5fe2fdee6f554221.avif?t=1755442471\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p>",
